author=AxLblahblah
description=Makes the Android 12 status bar show Wi-Fi directly to the left of the mobile signal/data icon (the iOS / Android 16 arrangement) via a systemless framework overlay. Reboot to apply. Remove the module and reboot to fully revert. Requires Android 12+.
